{
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "tm_intro_1",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "A disturbance in the timeline.",
   "mood": "serious"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_intro_2",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "Interesting. An anomaly of rather extraordinary proportions.",
   "mood": "serious"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_intro_3",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "Surely the work of a civilisation with a profound understanding of temporal mechanics.",
   "mood": "serious"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_intro_4",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "Oh.",
   "mood": "sarcastic"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_intro_5",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "Two mushrooms.",
   "mood": "sarcastic"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_intro_6",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "They've touched the beacon.",
   "mood": "sarcastic"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_intro_7",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "Of course they have.",
   "mood": "sarcastic"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_intro_8",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "Well, they have a few dozen heartbeats to put themselves back together before their connection collapses.",
   "mood": "serious"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_intro_9",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "Honestly. I leave the timeline unattended for five minutes...",
   "mood": "sarcastic"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_start",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "One of you lives in the past, one in the future. Record a loop, then catch up with yourself. Light the beacon in both.",
   "mood": "serious"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_loop_lock",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "The first loop is recorded. Now do try to keep up with yourself.",
   "mood": "smug"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_beats_5",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "Five beats left. Do try to look purposeful.",
   "mood": "sarcastic"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_beats_2",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "Two beats! Mushrooms! Please!",
   "mood": "urgent"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_paradox",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "A paradox. Splendid. Truly.",
   "mood": "sarcastic"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_stage_clear",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "Adequate. Next room.",
   "mood": "smug"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_charge_low",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "One chance remains. I would use it wisely. I would.",
   "mood": "urgent"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_forest_fail",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "And that is time. Splendid. Truly.",
   "mood": "sarcastic"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_forest_win",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "Well. They did it without me. How inconvenient.",
   "mood": "sarcastic"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_partner_hint",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "Your brother is trying something. Look for the cyan light.",
   "mood": "smug"
  },
  {
   "id": "jensen_cheer",
   "who": "JENSEN",
   "text": "Yay!",
   "mood": "cheery"
  },
  {
   "id": "sam_cheer",
   "who": "SAM",
   "text": "Woo!",
   "mood": "cheery"
  },
  {
   "id": "jensen_hmm",
   "who": "JENSEN",
   "text": "Hm?",
   "mood": "cheery"
  },
  {
   "id": "sam_hmm",
   "who": "SAM",
   "text": "Huh?",
   "mood": "cheery"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_office_1",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "Well. That went spectacularly badly.",
   "mood": "smug"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_office_2",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "Fortunately, I am the Time Master.",
   "mood": "smug"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_office_3",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "I can repair this entire mess in seconds.",
   "mood": "smug"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_office_4",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "All I require is a little gratitude.",
   "mood": "smug"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_office_5",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "Go on. Beg.",
   "mood": "smug"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_refuse",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "Very well. Into the soup.",
   "mood": "sarcastic"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_soup_after",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "There. Reality, repaired. You may thank me never.",
   "mood": "smug"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_accept_1",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "Excellent. I knew you had good manners.",
   "mood": "smug"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_accept_2",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "Now, naturally, you'll be doing the difficult part.",
   "mood": "smug"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_runner_win",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "And that, naturally, was entirely my doing.",
   "mood": "smug"
  },
  {
   "id": "tm_runner_fail",
   "who": "TIME_MASTER",
   "text": "No. No, no, no. This is not how it was meant to go.",
   "mood": "crying"
  }
 ],
